<title>FRANCE: French Dec M3 money supply fell 0.9 percent.</title>
<headline>French Dec M3 money supply fell 0.9 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of France gave the following money supply figures (the year-on-year change is expressed as an average centred on the previous month)</p>
<p> Money measure  Billions   Monthly change     12-month change</p>
<p> (end Sept)     (unadj)    (adjusted)	    Dec	 Nov</p>
<p>    M1	    1,813.4	 -0.2		 3.7	 5.7</p>
<p>    M2	    3,361.6	 -0.3		 6.0	 7.4</p>
<p>    M3	    5,333.0	 -0.9		-1.5	-1.0</p>
<p>    M4	    5,416.1	 -0.9		-1.2	-0.7</p>
</text>
